{
  "$comment": "Shared calculation fixtures for the browser preview and the server Pricing service (GOLD_IR_V1, MANUAL_LINE_V1, rounding IRR_LINE_HALF_UP_V1). All money values are IRR decimal strings. Both sides must pass every vector; the UI shows these as sample numbers only. Source: docs/prompts/PHASE_1_MASTER_PROMPT.md §7 worked examples, extended.",
  "formula_version": "GOLD_IR_V1",
  "rounding_policy": "IRR_LINE_HALF_UP_V1",
  "vat_rule_sample": {
    "id": "VAT_DEMO_GOLD_SERVICES",
    "version": 1,
    "rate_percent": "10",
    "status": "demonstration, not certified"
  },
  "vectors": [
    {
      "id": "base",
      "input": {
        "net_weight_g": "2",
        "purity_ppt": "750",
        "price18_irr_per_g": "100000000",
        "wage_percent": "2",
        "profit_percent": "5",
        "discount": null,
        "vat_rate_percent": "10"
      },
      "expected": {
        "M": "200000000",
        "W0": "4000000",
        "P0": "10200000",
        "C0": "0",
        "W": "4000000",
        "P": "10200000",
        "B": "14200000",
        "V": "1420000",
        "T": "215620000"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wage_discount",
      "input": {
        "net_weight_g": "2",
        "purity_ppt": "750",
        "price18_irr_per_g": "100000000",
        "wage_percent": "2",
        "profit_percent": "5",
        "discount": {
          "scope": "WAGE",
          "amount_irr": "1000000"
        },
        "vat_rate_percent": "10"
      },
      "expected": {
        "M": "200000000",
        "W0": "4000000",
        "P0": "10200000",
        "W": "3000000",
        "P": "10200000",
        "B": "13200000",
        "V": "1320000",
        "T": "214520000"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "taxable_components_discount_proportional",
      "input": {
        "net_weight_g": "2",
        "purity_ppt": "750",
        "price18_irr_per_g": "100000000",
        "wage_percent": "2",
        "profit_percent": "5",
        "discount": {
          "scope": "TAXABLE_COMPONENTS",
          "amount_irr": "1000000"
        },
        "vat_rate_percent": "10"
      },
      "expected": {
        "allocation_wage": "281690",
        "allocation_profit": "718310",
        "W": "3718310",
        "P": "9481690",
        "B": "13200000",
        "V": "1320000",
        "T": "214520000"
      },
      "$comment": "Allocation 1,000,000 × 4,000,000/14,200,000 = 281,690.14 → largest-remainder gives wage 281,690 and profit 718,310 (sum exact)."
    },
    {
      "id": "purity_900_no_services",
      "input": {
        "net_weight_g": "1",
        "purity_ppt": "900",
        "price18_irr_per_g": "100000000",
        "wage_percent": "0",
        "profit_percent": "0",
        "discount": null,
        "vat_rate_percent": "10"
      },
      "expected": {
        "effective_rate_irr_per_g": "120000000",
        "M": "120000000",
        "B": "0",
        "V": "0",
        "T": "120000000"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "purity_1000_row_independence",
      "input": {
        "net_weight_g": "2",
        "purity_ppt": "1000",
        "price18_irr_per_g": "100000000",
        "wage_percent": "2",
        "profit_percent": "5",
        "discount": null,
        "vat_rate_percent": "10"
      },
      "expected": {
        "effective_rate_irr_per_g": "133333333.333333333333333333",
        "M": "266666667",
        "W0": "5333333",
        "P0": "13600000",
        "B": "18933333",
        "V": "1893333",
        "T": "287493333"
      },
      "$comment": "Effective rate keeps ≥18 fractional digits internally; posted components round HALF_UP once. Changing this row's purity must not touch other rows. Corrected 2026-10-06: T = M + W + P + V = 266666667 + 5333333 + 13600000 + 1893333 = 287493333 (the earlier 288493333 was an arithmetic slip)."
    },
    {
      "id": "currency_display",
      "input": {
        "display_currency": "TOMAN",
        "displayed_price_per_g": "10000000"
      },
      "expected": {
        "stored_price18_irr_per_g": "100000000"
      },
      "$comment": "Exactly 10 IRR = 1 toman; unit label always visible."
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed_invoice_gold_plus_misc",
      "input": {
        "rows": [
          {
            "ref": "base"
          },
          {
            "item_type": "MISC",
            "title": "جعبه هدیه",
            "manual_price_irr": "2000000"
          }
        ]
      },
      "expected": {
        "gold_rows_total": "215620000",
        "misc_rows_total": "2000000",
        "payable_total": "217620000",
        "gold_vat_total": "1420000"
      },
      "$comment": "MISC never enters metal/wage/profit/VAT aggregates; payable = sum of posted row totals."
    },
    {
      "id": "discount_exceeds_eligible",
      "input": {
        "net_weight_g": "2",
        "purity_ppt": "750",
        "price18_irr_per_g": "100000000",
        "wage_percent": "2",
        "profit_percent": "5",
        "discount": {
          "scope": "TAXABLE_COMPONENTS",
          "amount_irr": "15000000"
        },
        "vat_rate_percent": "10"
      },
      "expected": {
        "error": "DISCOUNT_EXCEEDS_ELIGIBLE",
        "eligible_irr": "14200000"
      },
      "$comment": "Never clamp silently; UI shows «برای ادامه، مبلغ تخفیف را کمتر از مجموع اجرت و سود وارد کنید.»"
    },
    {
      "id": "persian_digit_parsing",
      "input": {
        "raw_weight": "۲٫۵",
        "raw_price": "۱۰٬۰۰۰٬۰۰۰"
      },
      "expected": {
        "net_weight_g": "2.5",
        "displayed_price_per_g": "10000000"
      }
    }
  ],
  "gold_in_vectors": {
    "$comment": "GOLD_IN_V1 (gold received from the customer instead of money). weight_750 = w×purity/750 HALF_UP to 0.001; G = round(w×purity/750×rate); T = round(exact gross × (100−d)/100); D = G−T; no VAT. Rate is IRR per gram of 18K (750). Credited against the sale: payable = sales − ΣT. Checked by tests/Unit/PricingVectorsTest.php and tests/js/pricing.test.mjs.",
    "formula_version": "GOLD_IN_V1",
    "vectors": [
      {
        "id": "in_old_gold_18k",
        "input": {
          "net_weight_g": "2",
          "purity_ppt": "750",
          "rate_irr_per_g": "100000000",
          "deduction_percent": "0"
        },
        "expected": {
          "weight_750": "2.000",
          "G": "200000000",
          "D": "0",
          "T": "200000000"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "in_coin_900",
        "input": {
          "net_weight_g": "8.13",
          "purity_ppt": "900",
          "rate_irr_per_g": "100000000",
          "deduction_percent": "0"
        },
        "expected": {
          "weight_750": "9.756",
          "G": "975600000",
          "D": "0",
          "T": "975600000"
        },
        "note": "Emami coin as in the reference invoice: 8.13 g at 900 = 9.756 g of 750."
      },
      {
        "id": "in_melted_deduction",
        "input": {
          "net_weight_g": "10.5",
          "purity_ppt": "705.5",
          "rate_irr_per_g": "98765432",
          "deduction_percent": "1.5"
        },
        "expected": {
          "weight_750": "9.877",
          "G": "975506172",
          "D": "14632593",
          "T": "960873579"
        },
        "note": "Melted gold with an assay purity and a 1.5% melting/impurity deduction."
      },
      {
        "id": "in_half_up",
        "input": {
          "net_weight_g": "0.001",
          "purity_ppt": "750",
          "rate_irr_per_g": "500",
          "deduction_percent": "0"
        },
        "expected": {
          "weight_750": "0.001",
          "G": "1",
          "D": "0",
          "T": "1"
        },
        "note": "0.5 IRR rounds up."
      },
      {
        "id": "in_fractional_deduction",
        "input": {
          "net_weight_g": "3.333333",
          "purity_ppt": "750",
          "rate_irr_per_g": "1",
          "deduction_percent": "33.3333"
        },
        "expected": {
          "weight_750": "3.333",
          "G": "3",
          "D": "1",
          "T": "2"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "in_error_deduction_range",
        "input": {
          "net_weight_g": "1",
          "purity_ppt": "750",
          "rate_irr_per_g": "100",
          "deduction_percent": "60"
        },
        "expected": {
          "error": "OUT_OF_RANGE",
          "field": "deduction_percent"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "in_error_purity_zero",
        "input": {
          "net_weight_g": "1",
          "purity_ppt": "0",
          "rate_irr_per_g": "100",
          "deduction_percent": "0"
        },
        "expected": {
          "error": "MUST_BE_POSITIVE",
          "field": "purity_ppt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "in_invoice_sale_minus_gold_in",
        "input": {
          "sale_ref": "base",
          "gold_in_refs": [
            "in_old_gold_18k"
          ]
        },
        "expected": {
          "sales_total": "215620000",
          "gold_in_total": "200000000",
          "payable": "15620000"
        },
        "note": "Sale row of vector 'base' (21,562,000 toman) paid partly with 2 g of 18K old gold."
      },
      {
        "id": "in_invoice_customer_credit",
        "input": {
          "sale_ref": "base",
          "gold_in_refs": [
            "in_coin_900"
          ]
        },
        "expected": {
          "sales_total": "215620000",
          "gold_in_total": "975600000",
          "payable": "-759980000"
        },
        "note": "Gold received exceeds the sale: negative payable = balance owed to the customer («مانده به نفع مشتری»)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "weight_settlement_vectors": {
    "$comment": "Weight settlement («تسویه وزنی» / «حساب وزنی»): gold is owed/credited in 750-grams instead of money. GOLD_IN: credit_750 = round3(w×purity/750×(100−d)/100). Sold GOLD settled by weight: debit_750 = round3(w×purity/750), money of the row = B + V of GOLD_IR_V1 (wage, profit, VAT only). Document gold balance = Σdebit − Σcredit (negative = shop owes the customer gold).",
    "vectors": [
      {
        "id": "w_in_coin",
        "input": {
          "kind": "GOLD_IN",
          "net_weight_g": "8.13",
          "purity_ppt": "900",
          "deduction_percent": "0"
        },
        "expected": {
          "weight_750": "9.756",
          "credit_750": "9.756",
          "T": "0"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "w_in_melted_deduction",
        "input": {
          "kind": "GOLD_IN",
          "net_weight_g": "10.5",
          "purity_ppt": "705.5",
          "deduction_percent": "1.5"
        },
        "expected": {
          "weight_750": "9.877",
          "credit_750": "9.729",
          "T": "0"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "w_sale_base",
        "input": {
          "kind": "GOLD",
          "ref": "base"
        },
        "expected": {
          "debit_750": "2.000",
          "money_irr": "15620000"
        },
        "note": "Vector 'base' settled by weight: only wage 4,000,000 + profit 10,200,000 + VAT 1,420,000 IRR are money."
      },
      {
        "id": "w_reference_invoice",
        "input": {
          "sale": {
            "net_weight_g": "10.16",
            "purity_ppt": "750"
          },
          "gold_in": [
            {
              "net_weight_g": "8.13",
              "purity_ppt": "900"
            },
            {
              "net_weight_g": "2.03",
              "purity_ppt": "750"
            }
          ]
        },
        "expected": {
          "gold_debit_750": "10.160",
          "gold_credit_750": "11.786",
          "gold_balance_750": "-1.626"
        },
        "note": "The reference (Tahesab) invoice: 10.16 g sold by weight; Emami coin and old gold received by weight; the shop owes the customer 1.626 g of 750."
      }
    ]
  }
}
